<!--
  Conservative identity allowlist for generated-monster-corpse loot spill.
  Each ID and exact runtime name was reviewed against data/items/items.srv and
  ordinary monster loot templates. Names omit the catalog's article because
  Items::loadItems extracts it before exposing ItemType.name.

  Membership never bypasses instance attributes, scripts, destination safety,
  complete-instance movement, or client-visible tile limits. Unknown identities
  remain in the corpse. This is not an NPC price table or sale authorization.

  No containers, food, currency, runes, keys, amulets, rings, charged equipment,
  quest-specific items, or boss-only uniques are included. Melee weapons have
  existing MultiUse flags and misc/weapons.lua actions in this catalog and are
  deliberately excluded pending a separate safety review. No script exception
  is authorized by this list.
-->
